Current engine status
GSWL V4.2 checks its sources hourly. The engine's checking frequency must not be confused with the publication frequency of each wage series (monthly, quarterly, semiannual, or annual).
Data-selection policy:
national official source > compatible supranational source > ILOSTAT fallback > retained latest official observation
Values based on different units or definitions must never be directly compared as though they belonged to the same series.
